title: "CMFS: Causal Mediation Feature Selection"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: MIT
# Add the Zenodo DOI after the first release.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aelnabawy/cmfs"
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX
abstract: >-
  Causal Mediation Feature Selection (CMFS) selects diagnostic biomarkers by the share of a
  disease's effect on a functional outcome that each feature carries, within ordered causal
  tiers, with cross-fitted discriminant indices and evidence grading of the selected features.
keywords:
  - causal mediation
  - feature selection
  - biomarker discovery
  - stroke
